<div class="tk" data-fig-scene="three-kinds"><div class="tk-col" data-anim="col"><div class="tk-head"><span class="fig-label">01</span><span class="tk-t">A tool</span></div><div class="tk-row"><span class="fig-label">Given</span><span class="tk-v">An action, every time</span></div><div class="tk-flow" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 30" width="14" height="30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 1v22"></path><path d="M2 18l5 5 5-5"></path></svg></div><div class="tk-row"><span class="fig-label">Comes back with</span><span class="tk-v tk-out">Exactly what you did</span></div><p class="tk-d">Does nothing until you pick it up. Stop touching it and nothing happens.</p></div><div class="tk-col" data-anim="col"><div class="tk-head"><span class="fig-label">02</span><span class="tk-t">Automation</span></div><div class="tk-row"><span class="fig-label">Given</span><span class="tk-v">A rule, written once</span></div><div class="tk-flow" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 30" width="14" height="30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 1v22"></path><path d="M2 18l5 5 5-5"></path></svg></div><div class="tk-row"><span class="fig-label">Comes back with</span><span class="tk-v tk-out">The same thing, forever</span></div><p class="tk-d">Fast, reliable and blind. It cannot notice what you did not anticipate.</p></div><div class="tk-col tk-live" data-anim="col"><div class="tk-head"><span class="fig-label">03</span><span class="tk-t">An agent</span></div><div class="tk-row"><span class="fig-label">Given</span><span class="tk-v">A goal, and permission to look</span></div><div class="tk-flow" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 30" width="14" height="30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 1v22"></path><path d="M2 18l5 5 5-5"></path></svg></div><div class="tk-row"><span class="fig-label">Comes back with</span><span class="tk-v tk-out">Things you never asked about</span></div><p class="tk-d">Goes and looks, works out what is wrong, and writes up what it wants to do.</p></div></div>
